  "description": "A romance after a hug?! A mistake by the Reaper caused Hae-in to die before her time. She was forced to live like a cat while getting her body back. The good thing is that she was taken in by a sweet man. The bad thing is that he was discovered by a veterinarian during a check-up to continue his life as a domestic cat. the vet discovered his true identity!\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=1776400)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=800775), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8923962)",
